        "original_id": "e6713311-bf61-5024-854d-00964d89755f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Leigh-Allyn Baker, Constance M. Burge, Aaron Spelling, Brad Kern, Molly Shannon, Tom Gallop\n- TV Series: Charmed, Will & Grace, Good Luck Charlie, Grace, Replaced\n- Companies/Networks: Spelling Television, The WB, Disney Channel\n\nFacts:\n- Leigh-Allyn Baker was born on March 13, 1972, and she is an American actress and voice artist.\n- Charmed is an American television series created by Constance M. Burge, produced by Aaron Spelling and Spelling Television, and run by showrunner Brad Kern.\n- Charmed was originally broadcast on The WB for eight seasons from October 7, 1998, to May 21, 2006.\n- Leigh-Allyn Baker had recurring roles on Charmed and Will & Grace.\n- Leigh-Allyn Baker starred as Amy Duncan, the matriarch on the Disney Channel sitcom Good Luck Charlie.\n- Molly Shannon, Leigh-Allyn Baker, and Tom Gallop guest starred on Grace, Replaced.",
